    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54433" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλοφάδεια</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰδ]</span>, Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόφος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὸν λόφον</span>
			, <i>on the neck</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βῆν δὲ
				καταλοφάδεια φέρων</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν
				ἔλαφον</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.169
			</span></i>: by metrical lengthening for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλοφάδια</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατωμάδιος</span>), v.
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
			</span></i> ad loc.--Perh. to be read divisim, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοφάδεια</span>.</div>
